00:06:53.584 --> 00:06:57.615
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:58.216 --> 00:07:05.295
<v Slow>生まれたアカマンボウの赤ちゃんは、どのくらいの大きさですか。

00:07:06.096 --> 00:07:09.767
<v Host>About seven millimeters — smaller than your fingernail.

00:07:10.367 --> 00:07:18.935
<v Slow>アカマンボウの体は、海の水より温かいですか、冷たいですか。

00:07:19.735 --> 00:07:25.663
<v Host>Warmer. It is the only fish in the world whose whole body stays warmer than the sea water.

00:07:26.264 --> 00:07:41.192
<v Host>That's all for today. An aquarium in Okinawa became the first in the world to hatch baby opah, a big warm-bodied ocean fish, and the tiny transparent babies are now on display. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

00:07:41.791 --> 00:07:44.192
<v News>また明日。
